    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690190/extras/8a98c09e40df8f63bfcc48ff34269d22.avif?t=1745420728\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in an adventure between worlds in the incredible pixel platformer Portal Walk and help Eugene find his way home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Search for keys, collect fragments of the portal, fight with a lot of difficult enemies and go to other worlds, moving through the levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690190/extras/92187cc5f1abbbaaef56deaeeaf6ec91.poster.avif?t=1745420728\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690190/extras/92187cc5f1abbbaaef56deaeeaf6ec91.webm?t=1745420728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690190/extras/92187cc5f1abbbaaef56deaeeaf6ec91.mp4?t=1745420728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u25cf Hardcore Levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u25cf Unique Worlds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u25cf Action Events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u25cf Challenging Bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u25cf Atmospheric Music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u25cf Steam Achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u25cf Support Game Controllers (Playstation DualShock, Xbox Wireless and other)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Indie Cup S'21 \u2013 Best Mobile Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Games Gathering 2021 \u2013 Best Art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Valencia Indie Summit 2022 \u2013 Selection of Jury</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pocket Gamer 2017 \u2013 7/10, Bronze Award</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Touch Arcade 2017 \u2013 Top 3 Hot Games</p>",
